    "updated_at": "2026-04-16T16:46:49Z",
    "body": "Another major benefit:\n\nBrowsers deprioritize background tabs to save on resources, which causes JS-enabled playlists to be interrupted (e.g. when the user turns the display off on a phone). Tabs that are playing audio are not deprioritized, and the same would be true if the audio is part of a playlist.",
